  "purpose": {
    "summary": "Traces causal chains across domain and regime boundaries; produces the directed Cross-Domain Causality Graph and CDCS.",
    "detail": "CDCW ingests the complete DRM from the Dimensional Overlay and all overlay reports from the S3 Spine bus. It constructs a directed causality graph by weighting cross-domain signal edges from the DRM and propagating structural fault signals across domain interfaces. The output is the Cross-Domain Causality Summary (CDCS) — a ranked list of cross-domain causal chains with confidence scores, influence weights, and estimated propagation timelines. CDCW is co-primary on the Domain Overlay alongside TRIADIC_REGIME_SYNTHESIZER."
  },
